# ==============================================================
# OCEAN PUZZLE - FINISH (11 of 11)
# ==============================================================
# Script type : walk
# Bind to     : [FILL IN: x y z] at the end of the Room 4 parkour
#               course, on the way to the next checkpoint. Bind to
#               every block of the path's width (one bind each), the
#               same way as the Entrance script, so nobody can step
#               around it.
# Map/area    : [FILL IN: map name / room]
# Import      : /script import walk <paste URL>, then click the block
#
# What it does:
#   The player has finished the whole Ocean Puzzle. Clears all of
#   their puzzle progress (answer, Room 1 and Room 3 solved
#   status, any unfinished altar offering or melody) and
#   disbands their team: every online teammate still on the same
#   team is told and removed from it. Teammates who haven't
#   finished keep ALL their own progress (nothing of theirs is
#   reset) and can still play the melody and run the parkour
#   on their own. Finish can also be placed farther down the
#   line, e.g. right at the next checkpoint.
#   The checkpoint beyond saves the player's map progress, so
#   nothing here needs to be kept. Once a player has finished,
#   walking over it again does nothing (until Reset).
#
#   ANTI-CHEAT: anyone who reaches this without having solved
#   Room 1, Room 3 AND played the Room 4 melody (solved,
#   solved3, solved4) is killed, which sends them back to the
#   puzzle area checkpoint. The next checkpoint must be past
#   this line so nobody can reach it without passing here.
#
# Requires: puzzle1 namespace (see Submit script header),
#   including:
#   /variable define puzzle1 relative Boolean solved4 = false
#   /variable define puzzle1 relative Boolean finished = false
# Related scripts: Instrument (10), Reset (4), Team Conduit (6)
# ==============================================================
@using puzzle1
@if finished
@return
@fi
# --- Anti-cheat: must have completed every room ---
@if !solved || !solved3 || !solved4
@player &3Oracle: &bThe deep does not know your song... and it will not let you pass.
@var player.setHealth(0.0D)
@return
@fi
@var finished = true
# --- Disband the team for everyone still on it ---
@if team != ""
@define String me = player.getUniqueId()
@define Player q = player
@for String id in team_members.split(",")
@if id != me
@var q = Player(id)
@if q != null
@if team[q] == team && q.isOnline()
@var team[q] = ""
@var team_members[q] = ""
@var q.sendMessage("§7§o[Note] {{player.getName()}} has completed the Ocean Puzzle, so your team has disbanded. Your own progress is kept: the instrument still awaits you.")
@fi
@fi
@fi
@done
@player &7&o[Note] You have completed the Ocean Puzzle, so your team has disbanded.
@fi
@var solved = false
@var solved3 = false
@var solved4 = false
@var altar_seq = ""
@var inst_started_at = 0L
@var inst_seq = ""
@var answer = ""
@var team = ""
@var team_members = ""
@player &3Oracle: &bThe deep releases you, seeker... Your song will echo in these halls long after you have gone.
